{"path":"/es/tip/25-09","title":"Hay que retirar por separado el dinero que se encuentra en distintos lugares: el saldo del fondo de vivienda, las prestaciones del seguro social y las indemnizaciones por accidente laboral | HowToLiveBetter","description":"Los herederos pueden retirar el saldo del fondo de previsión (Housing Provident Fund); este no se encuentra en la cuenta bancaria y es lo que más fác…","lang":"es","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter — inicio","href":"/es"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"Navegación principal"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Libro"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Top 50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Reto diario"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Mi lista"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Más"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmln